    c1a00001: fix Act 22 ledger verify for carried-forward checkpoints (O-1)
    
    predict-ledger.py cmd_verify treated Act 20 P1-P5 review_checkpoint entries as having no registration, flagging resolution_without_registration (5 defects, verify exit 1), which made predict-gate refuse any pilot bill. Per Act 22 s9 those checkpoints are carried forward, not re-registered, in a separate block; predict-scorer.py already applies Brier integrity only to kind==registration. Minimal fix: recognize review_checkpoint as a carried-forward registration for resolution validation, skipping Brier-only rules (self-resolution, outcome-evidence timing, due date) for those, keeping all checks on live registrations unchanged. Adds hermetic tests (clean carried-forward verify, tamper still detected, committed ledger verifies clean). Full run-all.sh green. No ballot, no enactment.

